# Local-only source art for the shared map-library catalogues (e.g. the Tom
# Cartos train set described in ../magirail-stock.md). Everything in this folder
# is gitignored and stays on this machine only; only the text catalogues beside
# it are committed. Re-downloadable from the user's CzePeku / Tom Cartos
# subscriptions. This .gitkeep keeps the folder present on a fresh clone.
